        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Southampton Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n<p>Even if you have never been to the Hamptons you can appreciate the exquisite elegance of the Southampton handleset. Omnia makes it, so you know that quality and safety are integral parts of the design. Tough, non-rusting materials paired with a made in the U.S.A. steel mortise lock insure that this entrance handleset will endure the test of time--making it not only well-made but beautiful too. Omnia's attention to detail in the Southampton entry set shows. Everything from the beaded edges to the fleur de lis that crowns the ends has been magnificently designed to bring the wealth of the Hamptons to your doors.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/decorative-fancy-door-knob-entry-door-lockset-omnia-d54294\"><b>Matching Lockset</b></a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" heigth=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\"></p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Southampton Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 11/4\" wide with a 11/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n<li>The Omnia <b>Max Brass Finish</b> is guaranteed never to tarnish even in extreme elements. Especially recommended for harsh environments such as salty air.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Southampton Handlseset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-3/4\" door thickness standard.</li>\r\n<li>Available with either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Length: 19-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 13-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p><i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Southampton Entrance Handleset Omnia",
                "description": "Omnia Southampton Mortise Entrance Handleset - Even if you have never been to the Hamptons you can appreciate the exquisite elegance of the Southampton handleset. Omnia makes it, so you know that quality and safety are integral parts of the design. Tough, non-rusting materials paired with a made in the U.S.A. steel mortise lock insure that this entrance handleset will endure the test of time--making it not only well-made but beautiful too. Omnia's attention to detail in the Southampton entry set shows. Everything from the beaded edges to the fleur de lis that crowns the ends has been magnificently designed to bring the wealth of the Hamptons to your doors.",
